#HELPS
1 HLA OAD~
Hla Oad is a small fishing village on the southern reaches of the Bitter Coast
where battered shacks surround a muddy square beside a small sheltered harbor.
Fisherfolk and paupers share few meager services above a hidden smugglers' den
as damp sea mist settles across the weathered settlement.
~
